      ],
      "source": "https://legacy.wisconsinhistory.org/Records/Article/CS5243"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Sokoagon Band traditionally visited Mole Lake each summer to fish and hunt before harvesting wild rice in the fall.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
