      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://legacy.wisconsinhistory.org/Records/Article/CS5243"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Tradition holds that the first chief of the Sokoagon Band was Getshee Ki-ji-wa-be-she-shi, also known as the Great Marten.",
